create a gitignore file for a Python project that ignores common files and directories such as __pycache__, .vscode, .env, and virtual environments.Here is a sample .gitignore file for a Python project that ignores common files and directories:```
# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files 
__pycache__/
# C extensions
*.so
# Distribution / packaging
dist/
build/
# Installer logs
pip-log.txt
# Unit test / coverage reports
htmlcov/
# Pytest cache
.pytest_cache/
# Virtual environment
venv/
# Environment variables
.env
# IDEs and editors
.vscode/
# Jupyter Notebook checkpoints
.ipynb_checkpoints/
# Python-specific files
*.pyc
# Logs
*.log
.venv/